{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_7_level_main_07-02_end","groupId":"main_7","stageId":"main_07-02","title":"變節之刃","storyCode":"7-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-02_end.txt","sourceHash":"3b954fb381e77ee3ada9e2029248b897d3e29068b4d1f54aea711c7974e7282e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"龍門上城區  7：20 p.m."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......你竟然這麼堅定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到。我沒想到，你......能讓我流血。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我們，哈，我們都，從來沒能......走出過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，你一直在這座城裡，而我......始終不在，也一直在逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我永遠都無法忍受這座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"最後還是變成了這種小打小鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我攔不住你了。你走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我走以後，請你代我去貧民區。貧民區的居民驚魂未定，該有人代表近衛局去保護他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有感染者的孩子，送你玩具小熊的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"收下吧。那是烏薩斯人教她們做的。因我們的失誤而喪生的米莎，教她們做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好。我會做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。我欠你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想聽你道歉。說實在的，你不適合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......該說都說完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"走！別再回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......珍重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"“無法忍受這座城市？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......有幾個人比你更在乎這座城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"謊話精......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_turf"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊督察！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？督察，你，你受傷了？誰能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我們剛剛、剛剛看見陳長官她——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那個，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有沒有時間好好聊聊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"督察......意思是你也要妨礙公務？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......也不能這麼說吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"出去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"是，魏公。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過......別再那麼稱呼我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"是。隨時聽候您的吩咐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希小姐和阿米婭妹妹，在你們說話前，我能先和他說上兩句嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，您說吧，文月小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我們相處很多年了，魏彥吾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼說這個——為什麼是現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我可是能從你眼睛裡看出你在想什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，哎。我向來都看得出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道龍門對你來說是你的一切，你的心血你的夢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不，文月......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但今天這一切不是你想要的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，（東國語道歉）。我不是在說我們進退兩難的處境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的是......你這拿自己一切換來的繁榮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經失去兩位親人了。不，用你的話說，三位，甚至是十幾位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你總不會還想讓自己的侄女也死在那吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"她痛恨影衛們。一旦讓他們去抓陳，她只會拼死反抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不，魏彥吾......我也不是在說這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你不後悔嗎？你要讓她們兩個全都死在異國的城市嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者又怎麼了？成了感染者，她們就不是你的侄女了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們有了孩子，難道也會被你這樣對待......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我所做的一切都是為了讓這片土地能夠變得更好，也從沒要陳暉潔去做該我做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"但她就是這個性子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"不，對她隱瞞，只是在她的心上繼續割肉而已。她只會覺得自己不屬於這裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你期望她去做的那些事情，太遙遠了，太難了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那我能夠停手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我身後的這些人，我腳下的這座城，我與他們角力了那麼久，卻也只能搏到這種結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......龍門能允許我停手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"是她想要這麼做，是她想要正本清源，是她想要這座城邦不再是我治下的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是教她如果那麼做，需要些什麼，又要放棄什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，行了。還解釋些什麼，耳朵都長繭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我去把她抓回來。我可不能看著她去送死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你做不了的事，我來做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐！不許......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經擬好了方案。我會把她帶回來，而你，文月，你不准走出這裡一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，你要攔我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（東國語）？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"唔哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？醫生，文月小姐剛說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是她提，我都快不記得東國有這麼粗魯的詞彙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾，是不是忘了我是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，我有底線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你還記不記得自己是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......醫生，我覺得......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（魏彥吾先生，是不是非常在乎文月小姐？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"（對文月來說亦然。也許......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，羅德島的二位。請羅德島幫助龍門城和小陳，要多少錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"我來出這個錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"文月小姐真要這樣委託嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這麼說不大好，但我家這位今天確實不在狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"或者說，對方的計謀實在是有點出乎我們意料，把他看重的東西全算計到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"對方不僅瞭解龍門，還非常瞭解他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月，不可再多言！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你管我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生，開價吧。我付得起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"文月小姐所說，我已經聽懂了。錢不是必要的，只是二位現在，能不能稍微聽我說兩句？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我不該在這時候進言。但恕我直言，龍門需要一些外力的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"文月小姐，我可以繼續說下去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"你說吧。我可沒有管別人說什麼的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......荒唐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島只是一家製藥公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，這片大地的形勢不允許任何人逍遙自在，何況是在市場、人事、政治傾向和國家利益中，均可能樹敵無數的製藥公司。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在各個國家的夾縫間遊走，對於我們而言，也是無奈之舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"當我們面對各個勢力施加給我們的巨大壓力時，我們需要自己獨特的制衡手段......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，這些手段起效的前提是——這些出謀劃策者的大腦中，切實還殘留著哪怕一絲理智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在特殊狀況隨時都會發生的今日，我們羅德島也必須準備好相應的對策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"說重點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個建議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你的建議確實有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，我不知道該不該向您透露這些資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"請您相信，憑龍門的實力與魏先生的本領，想消滅羅德島只需要一個眼神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的設備再先進，也沒辦法和魏先生手下的隊伍相提並論。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果忤逆您的意思，羅德島一定血流成河。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"請說。你與阿米婭小姐大可放心，我沒有餘力再去針對羅德島。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，沒什麼好忌諱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們與魏先生第一次交流時，魏先生也對我們擁有的武裝力量十分好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我可以坦白：就像剛才我說的那樣，在這方面，羅德島根本不配與龍門比較。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，無論是多強的武裝力量都會被局勢束縛，之間的區別，僅在於程度不一而同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是您的隊伍，被人捆住手腳也一樣無處發揮。哪怕是您親自上陣，對方依然有辦法拿到你的把柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上，我的同僚曾在一場籌款晚會上遇見過科西切公爵與她的養女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不是人口買賣的會場，也並非縱欲狂歡的貴族娛樂。那一次晚會上出席的所有人，都代表著不同的訴求和權力實體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......繼續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來的事情你應該已經有所預見，魏先生。那一次的晚會上，許多優秀的青年人憑他們的理論和構想，獲得了他們應得的價碼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但塔露拉沒有。也正是如此，我與我的同僚都沒有想到，這個少女會成長為今天的整合運動領袖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"事實上......我們早該想到，因為科西切公爵只在必要的場合出現，只做必要的事，除此之外，無聲無息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切不會展示自身的力量換取協助，塔露拉也沒有。之間的關聯，魏先生比我們更清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切公爵並沒有把她當作奴隸或是人質。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"她是他的繼承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，你的見聞佐證了我的想法。塔露拉是科西切的繼承人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，魏先生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切公爵知道你有什麼，也知道你能做什麼。塔露拉也一樣能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"請將這件事交給我們，魏先生。我們是最適合去解決本次事件的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"就像阿米婭之前說的那樣，羅德島與龍門間的正式合作已經結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，羅德島的艦船已經離開了龍門接舷區。羅德島離開龍門之後發生的事，與龍門毫無關聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭，可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生。我們......並不那麼關心龍門城的未來和你的私事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但陰謀家利用感染者引發的事件，它帶來的那些後果是我們拼盡全力去避免的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"如果魏先生允許，並且能給出承諾，承諾你不會使用任何武力攻擊我們的話——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"之後的戰鬥，就會是我們羅德島的戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我不依靠感染者，也不相信感染者。你們與整合運動的區別，在我看來，只是你們還沒與龍門敵對，僅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動之前又是怎麼樣的面貌？就算我們不記得，卻有人記得。他們本不是現在這副模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"言語可以修飾，意圖可以偽裝，整合運動再怎麼吹噓自己是改變感染者處境的力量，如今還是成了烏薩斯的炮灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"此事之後，烏薩斯將會輕鬆地撲滅整合運動的火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你們會不會是另一個整合運動？誰能證明，誰能證偽？你們會在什麼時候背叛，又會在哪裡對我們亮出獠牙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我並不相信你們有解決科西切繼承人的實力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那是科西切公爵......與他為敵且獲勝的，這麼多年來也只有龍門而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生，你打算自己帶領武裝力量，襲擊切爾諾伯格核心城，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不要妄加猜測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"方才，魏先生——你的觀點已經透露了你更深層次的想法。你認為只有你自己能做到這件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"確實，龍門有這個實力，你也有戰勝烏薩斯陰謀的經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這一次，你還打算用自己的死來抵消龍門宣戰的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如文月小姐所說，你覺得自己做了許多違心的事，你打算用死亡一勞永逸地償還所有過錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我一生犯錯無數，死亡並不足以償還，也不知向誰償還。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此，魏先生，你能保證在你死後，真的不會有人遷怒於你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門是大炎要地，我既保下了它，它的繁榮就依然能延續。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的是，文月夫人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（凱爾希醫生......好直白！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"醫生？！說什麼呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，魏先生。我害怕尊夫人會因為你而受到傷害。就算你死了，她也依然是你的遺孀。你知道的事，尊夫人基本上也都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"既然有人能迫使你做出違背意願的事情，我想，會做這樣的事情......也很正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎那位也不是個心思開闊豁達的人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了，真的夠了醫生！你說的實在太過分了，我不要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你認為即使我出手，也同樣保不下文月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可能並不只是文月小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"......我大可一同去，不就是死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"文月！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"唉唷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，凱爾希醫生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"為了你珍視的城市......以及真正珍視的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我懇求你，魏大人。把這件事情交給真正的專家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也許和任何勢力為敵我們都毫無勝算，但感染者，我們確實知根知底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們知道他們想要什麼，也知道他們不想要什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只有感染者才能對抗感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你想要什麼？羅德島的領袖，以及羅德島的醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是來這裡做慈善的。進攻核心城不僅是以卵擊石，它一定會令你們損失慘重，更可能是徒勞無功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"魏先生很清楚現狀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"到了這一步，雙方都說實話，會更符合我們的利益需求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不僅需要魏先生同意我們的作戰。我們還需要魏先生的承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使在未來，魏先生你可能會變卦......我們也想要承諾。對現在的承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我相信龍門和您的家庭，以及陳長官，值得一個承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"文月小姐，我們不需要您支付金錢。因為您的善良，您對感染者的態度，值得我們去執行一次無需回報的公正任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（小兔子......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文月","speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","isRemote":false,"text":"（比大拇指）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我同意。在龍門-切爾諾伯格事件結束之前，我們龍門絕不會再干涉任何羅德島的事務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，在我看來，醫生似乎欲言又止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧。你說什麼，我都暫時能夠承受。畢竟我也想請羅德島幫我救助一位感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，我還有一個提議。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彥吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼價碼，儘管開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"二十年前，愛德華·雅特利亞斯，也就是塔露拉·雅特利亞斯之父，死在了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望魏先生能把他的遺物借給我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["近衛局成員"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊","陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彥吾"]},{"speakerId":"char_2006_weiywfmzuki","aliases":["文月"]}]}
